### 세션 생성 - 권한 없음
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/session
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Name: {{username}}
X-User-Role: USER
X-User-ID: {{userId}}

{
  "organizationId": "org123",
  "publisher": "{{username}}",
  "name": "스파르타 세션",
  "count": 15,
  "status": "READY",
